# ==============================================================================
# ERP Digital Printing - Back Office App Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (Vite Dev Server)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Di local development, request diarahkan ke proxy Vite (/api/v1) agar menjadi Same-Origin.
# Ini memungkinkan cookie session tersimpan di HTTP (localhost) tanpa perlu local SSL/mkcert.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1

# Target proxy backend lokal (atau ubah ke remote staging URL jika dibutuhkan)
# Contoh: http://localhost:8000 atau https://api-made.wolfmother613.web.id
VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8000

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. SERVER / PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT (Docker Container)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Saat deploy container ke server (Docker / Kubernetes), proxy Vite TIDAK berjalan.
# URL API akan di-inject otomatis saat runtime container berjalan via entrypoint.sh:
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://api-made.wolfmother613.web.id/api/v1
#
# Catatan Server:
# - Frontend dan Backend wajib berjalan di atas HTTPS (SSL di-handle oleh Reverse Proxy server).
# - Backend wajib diset APP_ENV=production agar cookie otomatis mengaktifkan Secure: true & SameSite: None.
